<page>
<notes>Max factor at even position. The Y factors have even length, so their boundaries and the start of z_k have even positions. If a maximal codeword crosses out of a Y factor, its overlap s is in Z and has odd length; therefore its start has odd position. Positions are zero-based.</notes>
